---
title: Container - Orders (compact C4 flowchart adaptation)
config:
  flowchart:
    nodeSpacing: 25
    rankSpacing: 40
    padding: 12
    htmlLabels: false
---
flowchart LR
  customer(["Customer<br/>[Person]<br/>Places orders"])
  payments["Payments<br/>[Software System - external]<br/>Authorizes payments"]
  subgraph orders["Orders [Software System]"]
    web["Web UI<br/>[Container: React SPA]<br/>Order form"]
    api["Orders API<br/>[Container: Node.js]<br/>Accepts orders"]
    db[("Orders store<br/>[Container: PostgreSQL]<br/>Stores orders")]
    topic[("orders.created<br/>[Container: Kafka topic]<br/>Stores OrderCreated")]
    worker["Order worker<br/>[Container: Node.js]<br/>Starts fulfillment"]
  end
  customer -->|"Places orders using"| web
  web -->|"Submits order - JSON/HTTPS"| api
  api -->|"Writes orders - PostgreSQL/TLS"| db
  api -->|"Authorizes payment - JSON/HTTPS"| payments
  api -->|"Publishes OrderCreated - Kafka/TLS"| topic
  worker -->|"Subscribes to OrderCreated - Kafka/TLS"| topic
  classDef person fill:#083F75,stroke:#06315C,color:#FFFFFF
  classDef internal fill:#23A2D9,stroke:#0E7DAD,color:#152332
  classDef external fill:#8C8496,stroke:#736782,color:#000000
  class customer person
  class web,api,db,topic,worker internal
  class payments external
  style orders fill:none,stroke:#666666,stroke-width:1px,stroke-dasharray:8 4,color:#333333
  linkStyle default stroke:#666666,color:#333333

%% legend: Canonical draw.io C4 roles: dark blue Person, blue System, cyan Container, light cyan Component, muted violet external System. Mermaid glyphs adapt the native assets.
%% legend: Capsule adapts the person glyph. Plain rectangles adapt application glyphs. Cylinders are typed logical stores, including a Kafka topic.
%% legend: Gray dashed frame = software-system boundary. Arrows = named dependencies with protocols. The compact companion legend must remain visible with the diagram/export.
%% legend: Sizes accommodate content and carry no extra architectural meaning. Neutral relationship colors add no extra meaning. Arrowheads indicate the labeled direction.


%% legend: Exact C4 shapes require the native draw.io companion; Mermaid syntax cannot import the native assets.
